    "stdio stdout contains MCP protocol frames only; bounded JSON diagnostics use stderr",
    "remote export is disabled by default while local activities and safe logs remain available",
    "standard supported OTEL_* settings override the Observability section",
    "enabled invalid or insecure exporter configuration fails startup without echoing secrets",
    "one request span and one tool span are emitted with stable bounded names and correct parentage",
    "tool arguments and results are counted but never inspected or reserialized for telemetry",
    "metrics and destructive-attempt events remain independent of trace sampling",
    "export, collector, queue, and shutdown failures do not change MCP responses",
    "healthy telemetry is flushed within one total bounded shutdown budget",
    "registered tools and finite fallback values bound metric series, span names, logs, and limiter keys",
    "typed outcome metadata survives SDK error-result translation without message parsing",
    "the public 26-tool schema/result contract remains unchanged during migration",
    "self-contained and single-file published MCP executables remain supported"
  ]
